    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH184A8C2176B8F5DE54AFA33858DB61EE" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Loss and Unaccounted For (LAUF).&#160; LAUF incurred in the operation of the pipeline is tracked and flowed through to customers.&#160; LAUF amounts are recorded as a debit to account 813-Other Gas Supply Expense and a credit to account 812-Gas used for Other Operations.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHE4063DBCE82E5C1C75FB320ECD05B27A" xlink:to="HH184A8C2176B8F5DE54AFA33858DB61EE" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH7633CD4E75A567054BBBE78A1D58F688" xlink:label="HH7633CD4E75A567054BBBE78A1D58F688" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHEE90E4B53E9D1AB7BDB18B4326269502" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Fuel quantities requiring an allocation are assigned to the rate categories on the basis of the stated fuel rates as referenced in Order No. 710-C, at paragraph 9.&#160; Specifically, within each functional category, the fuel quantities in lines 8 &#8211; 30 are prorated to the rate categories based on the ratio of the Shipper Supplied quantities in lines 1 - 7 for each rate category to the total Shipper Supplied quantity for such functional category.</p>
        <p>Disposition of Excess Gas and Gas Acquired to Meet Deficiency quantities in lines 38 &#8211; 65 are prorated to the rate categories based on the ratio of the Excess or Deficiency quantities for each rate category to the total Excess or Deficiency quantity in line 37.</p>
        <p>&#160;</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH7633CD4E75A567054BBBE78A1D58F688" xlink:to="HHEE90E4B53E9D1AB7BDB18B4326269502" order="1" />
